*--------------------- MODEL CONVENTIONS ------------------------------

$ontext

The following conventions are followed
ENDOGENOUS and EXOGENOUS VARIABLES ARE IN UPPER CASE
parameters are in lower case
EXCEPT where parameters are linked to variables (??0 parameters)
NOTE GAMS is not case sensitive

All parameters and variables are listed alphabetically before programme
Initial values for variables are indicated by the suffix 0

Names follow convention row:column in abbreviations
regardless of whether they are modelled as expenditure or receipt driven


*##ABREVIATIONS
??CONST    constants in functional relationships
??MARG     marginals in functional relationships
??SH       shares of totals
??AV       averages in functional relationships

 COM        COMMODITY ACCOUNTS
 ACT        ACTIVITY ACCOUNTS
 VA         VALUE ADDED ACCOUNTS
 HO         HOUSEHOLD ACCOUNTS
 GOV        GOVERNMENT ACCOUNT
 CAP        CAPITAL ACCOUNT
 WOR        REST OF WORLD ACCOUNT

$offtext

*--------------------- END OF MODEL CONVENTIONS ------------------------
